  <ThingDef ParentName="Gun_AssaultRifle">
    <defName>YJZ_Weapon_Shenji_Assault</defName>
    <tradeability>None</tradeability>
    <generateCommonality>0</generateCommonality>
    <weaponTags Inherit="False" />
    <label>青芒灵铳</label>
    <description>“九层之台，起于累土。”——《道德经》

道书第一幅器图仍保留制式突击步枪结构，只在铳机内多出一圈与修炼者灵脉同频的青色符路。它不以奇迹取胜，却是此后一切武装变化的可靠根基。

效果：青羽机侍初醒时使用的可靠点射武器，是此后诸般炮形展开的根基。仅神机可以装备，青羽机侍、玄翎灵卫和九霄天将通用。</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Yunjianzi/Weapons/ShenjiCannon_Assault</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <shaderType>Cutout</shaderType>
      <!-- 枪身横向拉长，但不同比例放大厚度，保持普通人可肩射的步枪轮廓。 -->
      <drawSize>(1.42,1.10)</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
  </ThingDef>

  <ThingDef ParentName="Gun_Minigun">
    <defName>YJZ_Weapon_Shenji_Gatling</defName>
    <tradeability>None</tradeability>
    <generateCommonality>0</generateCommonality>
    <weaponTags Inherit="False" />
    <label>连星机括</label>
    <description>“枢始得其环中，以应无穷。”——《庄子》

道书第二幅炮图须待筑基方能展开：单一枪管围绕灵能中枢化作连星炮机。每一发都借下一发校正自身，密集弹流如群星循轨。

效果：连星机括发射密集离子弹流，落点会迸出小片爆光，尤其擅长压制聚集之敌。仅神机可以装备，青羽机侍、玄翎灵卫和九霄天将通用。</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Yunjianzi/Weapons/ShenjiCannon_Gatling</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <shaderType>Cutout</shaderType>
      <drawSize>(1.52,1.12)</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <verbs Inherit="false">
      <li>
        <verbClass>Verb_Shoot</verbClass><hasStandardCommand>true</hasStandardCommand>
        <defaultProjectile>YJZ_Projectile_ShenjiIonRound</defaultProjectile><warmupTime>2.5</warmupTime>
        <forcedMissRadius>1.1</forcedMissRadius>
        <range>30.9</range><burstShotCount>25</burstShotCount><ticksBetweenBurstShots>5</ticksBetweenBurstShots>
        <soundCast>Shot_Minigun</soundCast><soundCastTail>GunTail_Medium</soundCastTail><muzzleFlashScale>9</muzzleFlashScale>
      </li>
    </verbs>
  </ThingDef>

  <!-- 筑基离子弹：用原版 Projectile_Explosive 落点结算，半径仅覆盖命中点周围
       约一格。伤害低于普通迷你枪弹，但能有效处理紧密集群。 -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="BaseBullet">
    <defName>YJZ_Projectile_ShenjiIonRound</defName>
    <label>神机离子弹</label>
    <thingClass>Yunjianzi.Projectile_YunjianziIonRound</thingClass>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Projectile/Bullet_Small</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <shaderType>TransparentPostLight</shaderType>
      <color>(112,238,255)</color>
      <drawSize>(0.72,0.72)</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <projectile>
      <speed>70</speed>
      <damageDef>Bomb</damageDef>
      <damageAmountBase>8</damageAmountBase>
      <armorPenetrationBase>0.18</armorPenetrationBase>
      <explosionRadius>1.1</explosionRadius>
      <explosionDamageFalloff>true</explosionDamageFalloff>
      <explosionChanceToStartFire>0</explosionChanceToStartFire>
      <soundExplode>Explosion_Bomb</soundExplode>
    </projectile>
  </ThingDef>

  <!-- 紫府后的主射线与金丹折射射线使用神机专属的青白光束材质。
       使用帝国能量射线的伤害结算，避免普通射线受额外伤害系数压到1点；
       主射线基础伤害为10，折射射线为3，严格等于30%。 -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="MiliraBullet_Ray">
    <defName>YJZ_Projectile_ShenjiLaser</defName>
    <label>神机辉光</label>
    <thingClass>Yunjianzi.Projectile_YunjianziShenjiLaser</thingClass>
    <projectile>
      <damageDef>MI_Energy_Ray</damageDef>
      <damageAmountBase>10</damageAmountBase>
      <armorPenetrationBase>0.85</armorPenetrationBase>
      <stoppingPower>0.8</stoppingPower>
    </projectile>
  </ThingDef>

  <ThingDef ParentName="MiliraBullet_Ray">
    <defName>YJZ_Projectile_ShenjiChainLaser</defName>
    <label>神机折射辉光</label>
    <projectile>
      <damageDef>MI_Energy_Ray</damageDef>
      <damageAmountBase>3</damageAmountBase>
      <armorPenetrationBase>0.85</armorPenetrationBase>
      <beamStartOffset>0</beamStartOffset>
    </projectile>
  </ThingDef>

  <ThingDef ParentName="Gun_AssaultRifle" Name="YJZ_Weapon_Shenji_Gauss_Base">
    <defName>YJZ_Weapon_Shenji_Gauss</defName>
    <tradeability>None</tradeability>
    <generateCommonality>0</generateCommonality>
    <weaponTags Inherit="False" />
    <label>贯日光铳</label>
    <description>“电以照幽，雷以震妄。”

道书第三幅器图须以紫府神识读取，使神机武装舍弃实体弹丸，将日棱晶约束的能量压成青白辉光。这是上一代云间子对古人所谓“神光”的工程学解答。

效果：贯日光铳将能量约束为连绵辉光，能够迅疾洞穿远处之敌。仅神机可以装备，青羽机侍、玄翎灵卫和九霄天将通用。</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Yunjianzi/Weapons/ShenjiCannon_Gauss</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <shaderType>Cutout</shaderType>
      <drawSize>(1.64,1.15)</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <statBases>
      <RangedWeapon_Cooldown>0.25</RangedWeapon_Cooldown>
    </statBases>
    <verbs Inherit="false">
      <li>
        <verbClass>Verb_Shoot</verbClass><hasStandardCommand>true</hasStandardCommand>
        <defaultProjectile>YJZ_Projectile_ShenjiLaser</defaultProjectile><warmupTime>0.25</warmupTime>
        <range>35.9</range><burstShotCount>6</burstShotCount><ticksBetweenBurstShots>6</ticksBetweenBurstShots>
        <soundCast>Milira_Shot_RayRifle</soundCast><soundCastTail>GunTail_Heavy</soundCastTail><muzzleFlashScale>9</muzzleFlashScale>
      </li>
    </verbs>
  </ThingDef>

  <ThingDef ParentName="YJZ_Weapon_Shenji_Gauss_Base">
    <defName>YJZ_Weapon_Shenji_Legendary</defName>
    <label>九霄神光仪</label>
    <description>“大方无隅，大器晚成。”——《道德经》

道书最后一幅器图只写“以金丹为炉，以神机为器”。至此，贯日光铳原有的折叠结构完全展开，不再拘于寻常铳炮之形；主辉光贯穿目标，余能则由光仪阵列重新导向，在敌阵之间递次折射。

效果：九霄神光仪持续放出迅疾而深远的青白辉光；悟得流光千折后，余光还会循敌影递次折射。仅神机可以装备，青羽机侍、玄翎灵卫和九霄天将通用。</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Yunjianzi/Weapons/ShenjiCannon_Legendary</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <shaderType>Cutout</shaderType>
      <drawSize>(1.72,1.18)</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <statBases>
      <RangedWeapon_Cooldown>0.20</RangedWeapon_Cooldown>
    </statBases>
    <verbs Inherit="false">
      <li>
        <verbClass>Verb_Shoot</verbClass><hasStandardCommand>true</hasStandardCommand>
        <defaultProjectile>YJZ_Projectile_ShenjiLaser</defaultProjectile><warmupTime>0.20</warmupTime>
        <range>39.9</range><burstShotCount>8</burstShotCount><ticksBetweenBurstShots>4</ticksBetweenBurstShots>
        <soundCast>Milira_Shot_RayRifle</soundCast><soundCastTail>GunTail_Heavy</soundCastTail><muzzleFlashScale>11</muzzleFlashScale>
      </li>
    </verbs>
  </ThingDef>
</Defs>
